<title>THAILAND: Thailand's PTT to invest 25 bln baht in 1997.</title>
<headline>Thailand's PTT to invest 25 bln baht in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's state-run Petroleum Authority of Thailand (PTT) plans to invest 25 billion baht ($962 million) in 1997 in various energy projects, a company statement said on Monday.</p>
</text>
